ready: 1
kind: quality
id: stacks.quality.owner-only
display_id: QC-STACKS-OWNER
module: stacks
title: Only the owner's account reaches Kernle data
applies_to: [stacks.seq.resolve, stacks.seq.init, stacks.rule.credential-store]
measure: File and folder modes under the home, and requests from socket peers of another account
target: Folders are 0700 and files and the socket 0600 from creation; every request from another account is refused with nothing disclosed.
